{"path":"numeric/random/philox_engine/set_counter","title":"std::philox_engine<UIntType,w,n,r,consts>::set_counter","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::philox_engine&lt;UIntType,w,n,r,consts&gt;::</span>set_counter","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/set_counter","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Sets the counter of the random-number engine.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx26\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> set_counter<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>result_type, n<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> c <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx26\">(since C++26)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Sets the <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine#Generator_properties\">counter</a> of the random-number engine.\n</p>\n<ul><li> For each integer <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">k</span></code> in <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code><code>)</code></span>, sets <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize X_k\">X<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">k</span></span> to <span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize c_{n-1-k} \\mod 2^w\">c<span class=\"t-su t-su-b\">n-1-k</span> mod 2<span class=\"t-su\">w<br></span></span>.\n</li><li> The value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">j</span></code> is set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\">[1]</a></sup>\n</li></ul>\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">As <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">j</span></code> is being set to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code>, the next state transition always generates new random values.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> c\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> counter sequence to use to set the counter\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p><span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\scriptsize O(n)\">O(n)</span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/philox_engine\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/philox_engine/seed\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>seed</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets the current state of the engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/philox_engine","title":"std::philox_engine"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::philox_engine<UIntType,w,n,r,consts>::set_counter","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++26. Sets the counter of the random-number engine."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"c"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"O(n)."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs the engine"},{"label":"seed","note":"sets the current state of the engine"}]}]},"standards":["C++26"],"wordCount":93,"codeBlockCount":0}
